{"role":"assistant","content":"Now the scopes in `config.py` — each area exactly once, `:WRITE` where we write:","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_gMLEBgp5U0WeKR59WoGVYcgu","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"/private/tmp/h-unWmrw/config.py\",\"old_string\":\"SCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\\n\\nREFRESH_INTERVAL = 60      # seconds between passes of the token refresher\",\"new_string\":\"# Each area at most once: :WRITE implies :READ, and naming an area twice makes\\n# Intervals reject the authorize request (\\\"Duplicate scope\\\").\\nSCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\"}"}}]}
